  "payment_order": ["Credit/Debit Card"],
  "legal_rights": "Your Legal Rights",
  "legal_rights_text": "Our refund policy is in addition to and does not affect any of your legal rights. The simplest way to return your items is set out above, but you can also tell us you’ve changed your mind by completing and returning the cancellation form.",
  "complaints_text": "If you have any complaints about an online transaction, please get in touch via our Contact Us page and we will do our best to assist you.",

  "about_agora_title": "About Agora",
  "about_agora_text": "Agora was the first retail chain to open in Bangladesh in 2001. Since then, the store has been fulfilling the everyday shopping needs of customers through great price, a wide assortment of goods, best quality, and best service.\n\nBeing the first superstore of the country, Agora has contributed immensely to the growth of the industry. We have always maintained excellence in quality of products and operational standards to ensure a better market for the country. Agora always wants to ensure the best quality of products for its customers. In order to do so, Agora takes the required measures and ensures best business practices to build an ethical business source and believes in decentralizing and wants the healthiest produce to reach its customers across the country.\n\nCompetency skills of our employees are constantly developed through numerous trainings and certifications in GLOBALG.A.P. and Food Safety Management System (FSMS). Agora also received ISO 9001:2015 certification from Intertek for its quality management system.",

  "terms_conditions_title": "Terms & Conditions",
  "breadcrumb_home": "Home",
